# Agentic harness

Before implementing changes in this repo:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.agent/README.md` for the end-to-end agent loop.
2. Follow `.agent/rules/` — especially `architecture.md`, `angular.md`, `typescript.md`, `rxjs.md`, `testing.md`, `security.md`.
3. Mirror rules also live under `.cursor/rules/`.
4. Use the matching playbook under `.agent/workflows/`.
5. Keep feature isolation: no cross-feature imports; no feature logic in `shared/`.
6. Before finishing, run `npm run verify` (and `npm run e2e` for UI-critical work).
